---
description: Testing and quality rules
globs:
  - "**/*Test.java"
  - "**/*Tests.java"
  - "**/*Test.kt"
  - "**/test/**"
  - "evaluation/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Tests verify behavior, not implementation details.
- Cover normal, boundary, failure, authorization and duplicate-request cases.
- Use fixed clocks, deterministic IDs and fake providers where time/AI is involved.
- Do not assert only HTTP 200; assert the business result and persisted state.
- Contract tests must validate OpenAPI and JSON Schema examples.
- AI regression cases must be versioned and reproducible.
- A task is not complete until declared test commands have actually run.
